ce\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Detecting Presence</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>Searching for <a href=\"/wiki/Invisible\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Invisible\">Invisible</a> creatures within 3 m (10 ft) that must make a <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"DEX Save (Spell save DC)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Dexterity\" title=\"Dexterity\">DEX</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_throws\" title=\"Saving throws\">Save</a> (<a href=\"/wiki/Dice_rolls#Spell_save_DC\" title=\"Dice rolls\">Spell save DC</a>) or be <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Revealed_(Condition)\" title=\"Revealed (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/30/See_Invisibility_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-See_Invisibility_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/30/See_Invisibility_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-See_Invisibility_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/30/See_Invisibility_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-See_Invisibility_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Revealed\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/30/See_Invisibility_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-See_Invisibility_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/30/See_Invisibility_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\