idth=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_Throw\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Saving Throw\">Saving Throw</a> or lose their Invisibility.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715011331\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.065 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.071 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2229/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 29279/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 9096/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 26/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 4/1000\nLua time usage: 0.027/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1350273/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   59.276      1 Template:Condition_page\n100.00%   59.276      1 -total\n 60.31%   35.747      2 Template:Hidden_code\n 25.73%   15.250      2 Template:Condition_sources\n 21.90%   12.984      1 Template:PageSeo\n 19.39%   11.496      7 Template:Icon_text\n 18.23%   10.808      6 Template:Icon_link\n 16.61%    9.843     23 Template:Trim\n 12.44%    7.374      1 Template:Condition_sources/format\n 11.33%    6.718      1 Template:MdSAI\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:34238-0!canonical and timestamp 20260715011331 and revision id 382991. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}